1. ABOUT THIS SOFTWARE

Anti Emo is a Lua-based script developed for the Roblox game named
"The Strongest Battlegrounds" (TSB) — a popular anime fighting game on
the Roblox platform.

Development of the aim-lock system began in June 2025, after which the
project was temporarily paused and later resumed with continued active
development. This project is authored solely by anti emo and has been
built from the ground up — not copied, not forked, not stolen.

This software may actively maintained and regularly updated to keep up
with «some» game patches, mechanic changes, and new features.

What does it do? Simply put: it locks onto everything that moves.
Aim Lock, Prediction, Velocity Modification, Trusting, Cooldown
Bars, Mobile API support — if it exists in TSB, Anti Emo covers it.

